    "body": "This PR marks the `bitcoin-build-config.h` header with the dedicated [`IWYU pragma: always_keep`](https://github.com/include-what-you-use/include-what-you-use/blob/master/docs/IWYUPragmas.md#iwyu-pragma-always_keep), which makes the per-include `IWYU pragma: keep` comments redundant.\n\nAs a result, grepping for `IWYU pragma: keep` returns only the genuine use cases, each of which should be properly documented.",
