        "payload": "tree dacaa066828b46e2d170397557ede531d0fac4f4\nparent a527a0077a0fcae913188410214efe98021c0cca\nauthor Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1794684048 +0000\ncommitter Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1794684343 +0000\n\nscripted-diff: Drop `IWYU pragma: keep` from build config includes\n\nThe `bitcoin-build-config.h` header is now marked with\n`IWYU pragma: always_keep`, which makes the per-include\n`IWYU pragma: keep` comments redundant.\n\n-BEGIN VERIFY SCRIPT-\nOLD='#include <bitcoin-build-config.h> // IWYU pragma: keep'\nNEW='#include <bitcoin-build-config.h>'\nsed -i \"s|$OLD|$NEW|\" $(git grep -l \"$OLD\")\n\nGUARD='#ifndef BITCOIN_CONFIG_H'\nPRAGMA='// IWYU pragma: always_keep'\nsed -i \"s|^$GUARD$|$PRAGMA\\n\\n&|\" cmake/bitcoin-build-config.h.in\n\nSTALE='^Make sure to include it with the IWYU pragma'\nsed -i \"/$STALE/,+2d\" test/lint/test_runner/src/lint_cpp.rs\n-END VERIFY SCRIPT-\n",
